        "edit": "No change: the RTL already uses edge-triggered always @(posedge CLR or posedge F_IN) with synchronous reset and enable, matching the expected behavior; the observed cycle-0 mismatch (got 0 vs expected x) is consistent with an uninitialized-register oracle rather than a logic defect in this block.",
